5. **Workshop:** The Hydroponics person isn't geology, the Observatory person is medicine, and Tomas isn't geology. So whoever is in the Workshop has geology.
6. **Last step:** The afternoon person is robotics (Aspen's fragment). So Mara isn't Observatory (medicine) or Workshop (geology), which leaves Hydroponics. Medicine must come before the Workshop shift, so Kofi (dusk) is Observatory and Lena (night) is Workshop. Tomas gets the remaining specialty, botany.

